{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the priest shall dip.</b> It is the anointed one himself. The reason for seven times you will find in the pericope of Vayera and Balak. And because of the great eminence of the high priest, he shall sprinkle the blood of his sin-offering on the parochet of the sanctuary and on the horns of the altar of incense, and the entire bull, apart from the fats, he shall burn outside, for it is not a burnt-offering."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:33.201175346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}